OL,3,GNEWSA'People can't believe their eyes'
OL,4,A- the TikToker highlighting housing
OL,5,Ahorrors
OL,6,
OL,7,FWho doesn't love a good scroll through
OL,8,FRightmove?
OL,10,FJack Bushrod has turned it into his
OL,11,Fjob, spending hours looking for unusual
OL,12,Fhomes to post on his Housing Horrors
OL,13,Faccounts on Instagram, TikTok and
OL,14,FFacebook.
OL,16,FRecent "horrors" including a
OL,17,FNottinghamshire property - dubbed "the
OL,18,Fscariest house on Rightmove" - largely
OL,19,Fdue to a creepy doll left standing in
OL,20,Fthe corner of a bedroom.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
